<speak>We're using a drawer in the study, but at the moment it contains everything from appliance manuals to a programme from a school concert. I opened it last weekend and found a warranty for a kettle we no longer own. We had a good laugh about that. The renovation folder is going to live somewhere separate. My wife suggested a labelled box on the shelf, which is probably better than my habit of leaving a neat pile on the desk and calling that a system.</speak>